 validation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared maintenance locking, staged replacement, recovery records, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accurate failure outcomes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Implement a lossless Markdown status-group transformation[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]status_group_transform[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]status_group_transform: preserve task subtrees and authored topic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]context while producing stable status headings, source-aware change [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records, and conservative skip diagnostics.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrate grouping, reporting, compatibility, and acceptance [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]coverage[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]integrate_status_groups[dim] · [dim][/dim]after guarded_writes, status_group_transform[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integrate_status_groups: compose grouping after final status derivation,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enable guarded structural writes, expose clear reports, and verify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture and collection compatibility.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-1y","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-1y.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f775f0c7777e0a26fedfe1fee801764d","started_at":"2026-09-10T15:34:05.714609+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1y.land"]}
